<title>USA: Agree Realty Corp Q4 FFO rises.</title>
<headline>Agree Realty Corp Q4 FFO rises.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGTON HILLS, Mich. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended  Year ended</p>
<p>					   December 31,    December 31,</p>
<p>					  1996     1995    1996    1995</p>
<p> Total Revenues		    $4,525  $3,612 $16,696 $13,698</p>
<p> Property operating expenses	676     578   2,485   2,048</p>
<p> Depreciation and amortization    812     597   2,966   2,317</p>
<p> General and administrative	 326     266   1,105     966</p>
<p> Interest expense		   1,590   1,133   6,101   4,335</p>
<p> Total Expenses		     3,404   2,574  12,657   9,666</p>
<p> Other income			   594	 -     594	 -</p>
<p>Income before minority interest</p>
<p>					  1,715   1,038   4,633   4,032</p>
<p> Minority interest expense	  333     202     899     785</p>
<p> Net income			   1,382     836   3,734   3,247</p>
<p>Weighted average number of shares   and OP Units outstanding	3,287   3,276   3,287   3,276</p>
<p> Income per share		    0.52    0.32    1.41    1.23</p>
<p>Funds from operations (1) Funds from operations - Revised</p>
<p>					  1,951   1,644   7,076   6,389</p>
<p>Funds from operations per share</p>
<p>					   0.59    0.50    2.15    1.95</p>
<p>	     (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>(1) Funds from operations includes net income plus certain non-cash charges including depreciation of real estate assets, amortization of leasing costs and costs associated with employee stock awards.</p>
<p>Agree Realty, a real estate investment trust, holds interests in 32 properties in 12 states.</p>
